Because the Succubus's **Seduction** spell is a powerful crowd control (CC) that is absolutely required for warlocks to succeed in PvP and dungeons. As a result, warlocks constantly summon Succubi in cities and group content to cast it, making them highly visible to other players. When actually solo-leveling out in the world, those same warlocks use the Voidwalker for tanking, but because the Succubus is seen so often in social areas, players mistakenly assume she is the most common leveling pet. [end of text]


